[Changelog] v1.55

You can now specify whether each skill spam key uses the configured HoldKey or not.

Previously, all skill spam keys automatically used the HoldKey if it was set.

Now, you control this behavior per key by adding :false after each key in the config.

Example:
skillSpamClickKeys = F1,F2:false means

F1 will use HoldKey (default = true)

F2 will not use HoldKey

If you omit the :false suffix, keys default to using HoldKey (true) if the holdkey is set.

